<title>INDIA: India - Forward dollar rates-Feb 24.</title>
<headline>India - Forward dollar rates-Feb 24.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bombay banks quoted the forward premia on dollar at the following rates (in paise):</p>
<p>	     Cash Spot    Cash Tom	Tom Spot</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  TIME	Bid/Ask	Bid/Ask	Bid/Ask</p>
<p>(in IST)</p>
